  "adaptations": [
    "Owned typed original player MUSIC delivery and client mutation-before-engine-result",
    "Bounded atoi decimal-prefix/byte conversion and safe client name limits; source motif/break no-ops are explicit",
    "One preflighted pending replacement; immediate or next musical section end, latest accepted request wins",
    "Split instrument mixer at the exact deadline; cancel old events and tails without resetting time or WAV voices",
    "Fresh/NEW_LEVEL entry SilenceList and immediate world exit; real transport and failure inspection"
  ],
  "limits": [
    "20 percent gain, per-section seed 1 and fixed prepared-variation repeats remain explicit",
    "Latest-request/tail-cut/preroll policy is replacement code, not verified retail IMUSIC activation",
    "CD audio, enable/volume settings, saved client music state and all-bank support remain outside this increment",
    "M2 exit criteria unchanged; real music playback does not certify the complete preservation gate"
  ],
